{
  "fixture": "group-keys",
  "version": 1,
  "encoding": {
    "cells": "chartGroupRefs(value, field, ctx) for one X cell (WP11 1.4). `value` by field type: an option id or a list of ids (selects), true/false (Checkbox), a local date-time string without a zone (dates, read in local time like `now`), a list of person ids (Person), one user id (CreatedBy, LastEditedBy), a list of related row ids (Relation), text (RichText, URL) or a number (Number); null is no value. `field.persons` are the Person type option's people, `field.members` the workspace members, `field.relationTitles` the related rows' titles. `dateCondition` is a DateConditionPB name (Month when absent), `textGrouping` exact or first_letter (exact when absent), `buckets` the resolved number ranges. `expect` lists the groups in the order the cell yields them (distinct ids, first occurrence first).",
    "hint": "{\"rank\": n} or {\"rank\": n, \"tie\": key} for ranked groups, {\"label\": true} for label-ordered groups (the empty group too, which every sort puts last anyway). \"Infinity\" and \"-Infinity\" stand for the infinite ranks.",
    "labels": "The English labels below; Number labels use R-FORMAT axis mode (en-US) with the X field's numberFormat, an en dash between the bounds, and canonicalNumber bounds.",
    "canonicalNumber": "[input, expected key text]; -0.0 is negative zero.",
    "niceStep": "[x, the smallest of {1, 2, 5} x 10^k that is at least x]; 1 for x <= 0.",
    "numberBuckets": "resolveNumberBuckets(values, settings), then the groups with rows in ascending order with their row counts; expect null means no ranges (no numbers).",
    "sort": "sortChartGroups(groups, xSort, manualOrder) -> keys. Equal labels in the default order fall back to the keys by code unit.",
    "labelCompare": "[a, b, sign of compareChartLabels(a, b)]: normalizeDashboardText, then code units, then the raw strings by code unit."
  },
  "labels": {
    "checked": "Checked",
    "unchecked": "Unchecked",
    "noFieldValue": "No {field}",
    "emptyFieldName": "Empty",
    "weekOf": "Week of {start} - {end}",
    "relative": {
      "last_30_days": "Last 30 days",
      "last_7_days": "Last 7 days",
      "yesterday": "Yesterday",
      "today": "Today",
      "tomorrow": "Tomorrow",
      "next_7_days": "Next 7 days",
      "next_30_days": "Next 30 days"
    },
    "unknownPerson": "Unknown person",
    "unknownUser": "Unknown user",
    "untitled": "Untitled"
  },
